{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_01",
      "hash": "7a4c10300efd7ddb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "寶可夢在空中飛\\n的遊戲很不錯吧……！\\c\\n要是真的能飛起來，\\n一定會比遊戲更好玩呢……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_02",
      "hash": "7a4c11300efd7f8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦！[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳很在意吧！？\\n我和我這台機器！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想聽聽看嗎！？\\n關於這個的事！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_03",
      "hash": "7a4c12300efd8141",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，這樣啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_04",
      "hash": "7a4c13300efd82f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呼～真拿[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳沒辦法！\\n這台機器啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_05",
      "hash": "7a4c14300efd84a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能飛往！廣闊的！天空！\\n是個！非常棒的！交通工具！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_06",
      "hash": "7a4c15300efd865a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……連我自己都覺得這個發明很厲害！\\n要說它是[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術[VAR COLOR(0000)]也不為過。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_07",
      "hash": "7a4c16300efd880d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可是，難得把它造了出來，\\n卻沒人敢坐上去，真傷腦筋。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_08",
      "hash": "7a4c07300efd6e90",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我看[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好像挺勇敢的。\\c\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術「凌空渡」[VAR COLOR(0000)]！\\n我來教[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳怎麼坐吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_09",
      "hash": "7a4c08300efd7043",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦！？莫非那隻[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n想要來駕駛這個嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_10",
      "hash": "7a4f15300effbc31",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "太好了！\\n這完全符合我的靈感呢！\\r\\n那麼……"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_11",
      "hash": "7a4f14300effba7e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "把這裡這樣再那樣……\\n拉～一下方向盤！\\c\\n那個就會變那樣，然後……\\n用氣球飛上天～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub072_sys_01",
      "hash": "18c58e2029345768",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)]學會了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術「凌空渡」[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub072_sys_02",
      "hash": "18c5912029345c81",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "使用[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術「凌空渡」[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n就能飛往[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳曾到訪過的城鎮去！\\c\\n從Ｘ選單的「和[VAR PKNICK(0003)]玩」中\\n選擇秘術吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_12",
      "hash": "7a4f13300effb8cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我把這台機器送給你們。\\n你們要多用它到空中冒險喔！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_13",
      "hash": "7a4f12300effb718",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "凌空渡好玩嗎？\\c\\n下次要造個怎麼樣的\\n機器好呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub072_child_m_01",
      "hash": "1da1b925a9413f05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 15]"
    },
